{"publicId":"4cf3574e-61a9-4b36-8eb1-7a6185c8bf24","title":"Arete-27B模型宣传率从22%降至低于1%","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-07T12:32:45.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-07T12:32:45.000Z","digest":"Nous Research 对阿里巴巴的Qwen3.8-27B模型进行微调，发布去政治化后的Arete-27B模型，政治宣传率从22%降至0.9%以下，同时自由言论得分从0.89提升至2.44（与Mistral Large 4相当）。\n\n原版Qwen3.8-27B factual accuracy得分为2.32/5，22%的回答含政治宣传；西方模型Mistral Large 4和Gemma 4 31B宣传率低于1%，而GLM-5.3和DeepSeek V4.1 Flash得分分别为15%和16%。\n\n测试显示新模型在保持原有能力的同时，政治宣传率显著降低，但未提及具体测试样本量或评估标准。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-07T13:16:08.302Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Nous Research 发布 Arete-27B 模型，政治宣传率从22%降至0.9%","latestReport":{"id":"hdkf2blrmbk6chdap0w6bt5jw"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fp8jDHAZ1z-4","title":"Arete-27B模型的宣传率从22%降至不到1%","firstReportAt":"2026-11-07T12:32:45.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"hdkf2blrmbk6chdap0w6bt5jw","title":"Nous Research 发布 Arete-27B 模型，政治宣传率从22%降至0.9%","summary":"Nous Research 对阿里巴巴的Qwen3.8-27B进行微调，发布去政治化后的Arete-27B模型，政治宣传率从22%降至0.9%。测试显示Arete-27B在自由言论类别得分从0.89提升至2.44，与西方模型Mistral Large 4相当，同时保持原有能力。","source":{"name":"The Decoder","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-07T12:32:45.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"hdkf2blrmbk6chdap0w6bt5jw","title":"Nous Research 发布 Arete-27B 模型，政治宣传率从22%降至0.9%","summary":"Nous Research 对阿里巴巴的Qwen3.8-27B进行微调，发布去政治化后的Arete-27B模型，政治宣传率从22%降至0.9%。测试显示Arete-27B在自由言论类别得分从0.89提升至2.44，与西方模型Mistral Large 4相当，同时保持原有能力。","source":{"name":"The Decoder","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-07T12:32:45.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-07T14:00:00.000Z","heat":9.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T15:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T16:00:00.000Z","heat":9.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T17:00:00.000Z","heat":8.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11